        "title": "No bot challenge on public pages",
        "summary": "fetch as \"CumulusAgentFetch/1.0\": 403 in 1 ms, 5,608 bytes — agent fetch content-type: text/html; charset=UTF-8 — rendered challenge: markers: just a moment",
        "evidence": [
          [
